  "claim": "The cover, Anthony Davis, for the main game of the video game that features Fergie's song  \"L.A. Love (La La)\" earned a gold medal playing with Team USA at the 2012 Summer Commonwealth Games.",
  "evidencia": "Page: NBA 2K16. Sentence: There are three different covers for the main game, one featuring Anthony Davis of the New Orleans Pelicans, another featuring Stephen Curry of the Golden State Warriors, and the last featuring James Harden of the Houston Rockets.\nPage: Anthony Davis (basketball). Sentence: He also earned a gold medal playing with Team USA at the 2012 Summer Olympics.\nPage: L.A. Love (La La). Sentence: \"L.A. Love (La La)\" was used as background music in commercials for the 2015 Chrysler 200 and was also used as the theme song for the reality television series \"Kourtney and Khloé Take The Hamptons and Togetherness\" and video game \"NBA 2K16\".",
