        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Anthony Davis, Fergie\n- Products: NBA 2K16, \"L.A. Love (La La)\"\n- Organizations: Team USA\n- Events: 2012 Summer Olympics, Commonwealth Games\n\nFacts:\n- Fergie's song \"L.A. Love (La La)\" appeared in the main game soundtrack of NBA 2K16.\n- Anthony Davis was the cover athlete for the main edition of NBA 2K16.\n- Anthony Davis won a gold medal with Team USA in men's basketball at the 2012 Summer Olympics.\n- The statement incorrectly refers to the \"2012 Summer Commonwealth Games,\" because Anthony Davis competed for Team USA at the Olympics, not the Commonwealth Games.",
