        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Anthony Davis, Stephen Curry, James Harden\n- Organizations: New Orleans Pelicans, Golden State Warriors, Houston Rockets, Team USA\n- Products: NBA 2K16, 2015 Chrysler 200\n- Creative Works: \"L.A. Love (La La)\", Kourtney and Khloé Take The Hamptons, Togetherness\n- Events: 2012 Summer Olympics\n\nFacts:\n- Anthony Davis earned a gold medal with Team USA at the 2012 Summer Olympics.\n- NBA 2K16 has three different main-game covers featuring Anthony Davis of the New Orleans Pelicans, Stephen Curry of the Golden State Warriors, and James Harden of the Houston Rockets.\n- \"L.A. Love (La La)\" was used in commercials for the 2015 Chrysler 200.\n- \"L.A. Love (La La)\" was used as the theme song for Kourtney and Khloé Take The Hamptons, Togetherness, and the video game NBA 2K16.",
